Instagram is a social media platform which is used to share media such as photo , video.
So, functional requirements inlucde:-
   User can post a photo/video.
   User can follow another users.
   User should be able to see the recent posts , when the feed is uploaded.
And, non-functional requirements include :-
   High Availability
   Low Latency
   High Scalability
   Durability
   And eventual consistency is allowed.

